  "kernel": "e23dd724178388a398c7dd3bdb4d4f78b40baf68",
  "kernel_repo": "Aiden-HQ/AidenHQ",
  "notes": [
    "May add authority (grants, writes, roles or secrets) in: agent-builder, ai-reviewer. Auto-updates accept it; turn them off to review first.",
    "Agent work layout with kernel lanes, filters and saved boards",
    "Rank findings by active exploitation (KEV, EPSS, Zero Wire)",
    "On_push's mandatory combo is optional on a gated repo",
    "Fleet PRs close their issue with Fixes #N; drop the after-merge close loop",
    "Engineers run a Codex review before publishing",
    "Skip ignored repos in the PR detector",
    "One-off repo reviews with Primer reports",
    "Notify_recent ledger of what the owner was told",
    "Memory curation reads agents' work and keeps memory as positive guidance",
    "Reviewed setup PR op and private Primer report publishing",
    "Agents record a finding's outcome without a GitHub write",
    "Optional GitHub App carries code review's writes, per org",
    "Nits go in the summary only, no inline thread per nit",
    "Bounded disk: closed and idle task workspaces, build cache and logs are cleaned automatically",
    "Add api.member_paths for member API routes",
    "Repo reviews form and reports",
    "Allow app_api signed-in member requests",
    "One install spend limit, daily and monthly; every other budget removed",
    "Important findings need a failure scenario; no re-review on a bare rebase or a deploy; findings gate once posted"
  ],
  "release": "2026.11.22"
}
